          "$A(x+3)+B(x-2)=x+7$; $x=2$: $5A=9... $ wait $A(5)=9\\Rightarrow A=\\frac{9}{5}$; $x=-3$: $B(-5)=4\\Rightarrow B=-\\frac{4}{5}$."
